## Quality Check

Before final output, verify:
- the first screen explains what the subject is for;
- the main sections match the audience lens;
- operator or end-user reports emphasize features, workflows, controls, surfaces, and spatial model;
- section titles answer reader needs;
- no block exceeds 5 bullets;
- average block length is near 4 bullets;
- bullets are short and atomic;
- no bullet is included only because it is true;
- source-backed context is not buried under caveats or implementation inventory;
- the feature register was created before the summary;
